abstract: >-
  Code and results accompanying "Rules, Learning, or Both? A Controlled
  Study of Bank-to-Ledger Transaction Matching Under Noise and Distribution
  Shift". A reproducible synthetic benchmark comparing rule-based, learned
  and hybrid bank-to-ledger transaction matching. All data is synthetic; a
  verification script checks every number reported in the paper.
